  "notable_quotes": [
    "Activated 1 is thermally robust: it loses 10.56% mass from 25-150 °C, remains stable to 400 °C, and retains crystallinity after 15 heating cycles to 60 °C under vacuum.",
    "Even with reduced amine participation, cooperative CO2-CO2 interactions in 1 increase overall binding by more than 7 kJ mol−1, which is significant for porous CO2 capture.",
    "{Zn3(Atz)3(PO4)} (1) has larger amine-lined pores than {Zn2(Atz)2(ox)} (2) because fewer phosphate anions are needed to charge-balance the Zn-Atz layers."
